// An executable whose build program turns its call paths off (`build::trace_calls`) still
// names the function a panic is in: its path is that one line.
//# project
//# $ {t}
//# panic: {dir}/main.ctx:1:42: panic: index 2 out of bounds for length 2
//# path:
//|   at third ({dir}/main.ctx:1:42)

// So does `ctxc run`, which builds it the same way.
//# $ ctxc run .
//# panic: ./main.ctx:1:42: panic: index 2 out of bounds for length 2
//# path:
//|   at third (./main.ctx:1:42)
